FFmpeg master 90f5e61a1da2 (2026-11-05), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2;
CVE-2026-125224:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/90f5e61a1da2dcc0050169af8ca593530f26071b

Vorbis parser: invalid extradata was parsed again for every packet; a Matroska
file with large invalid Vorbis extradata and many packets kept ffprobe and
ffmpeg busy for a long time. Now parsed once.

